===Etymology===
From the Greek "katarrhein": kata- meaning "down" and rhein meaning "to flow."

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{pathology}} [[inflammation]] of the [[mucous membrane]]s of the [[nose]] and [[throat]].

